            </li>
            <li>
                <a hard href="/reference/errors/E-DERIVED-VALUE-MUTATE" class="text-rose-700 hover:text-rose-900 underline">E-DERIVED-VALUE-MUTATE</a>
            </li>
            <li>
                <a hard href="/reference/errors/E-SYNTHESIZED-WRITE" class="text-rose-700 hover:text-rose-900 underline">E-SYNTHESIZED-WRITE</a>
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mt-10 mb-4">
            Specification
        </h2>

        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
            Normative text: <strong>§6.6.8, §6.6.16, §6.6.17, §6.6.18, §34</strong>. Spec lives at
            <a href="https://github.com/bryanmaclee/scrml/blob/main/compiler/SPEC.md"
               class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900 underline">
                compiler/SPEC.md
            </a>.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-10 text-sm">
            <a hard href="/reference" class="text-blue-700 hover:text-blue-900 underline">
                &larr; Reference
            </a>
        </p>

    </article>

</>
